{"id":"6e365137dcbb1ce1","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md","title":"Iterated Forcing","display":"thm-iterated-forcing — Iterated Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-iterated-forcing","aliases":["58-thm-iterated-forcing","Iteration Lemma","Product Forcing"],"display":"thm-iterated-forcing — Iterated Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","[[58-df-generic]]","[[58-df-generic-extension]]","[[58-df-name-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-iterated-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-iterated-forcing</span><span>Iteration Lemma</span><span>Product Forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iterated-forcing — Iterated Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"054f5df77a4bd18d\" href=\"?note=054f5df77a4bd18d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration\">58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension\">58-df-generic-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"58-df-name-evaluation\">58-df-name-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,N_2,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q},\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb R,G,H,K\\in V\">\\(M,N,N_2,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q},\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb R,G,H,K\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\preccurlyeq_Q,1_Q\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\preccurlyeq_Q,1_Q\\rangle\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\">\\(\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\\)</span> is the exact iteration predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"054f5df77a4bd18d\" href=\"?note=054f5df77a4bd18d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration\">58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Generic}\">\\(\\operatorname{Generic}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension\">58-df-generic-extension</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}\\)</span> is name evaluation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"58-df-name-evaluation\">58-df-name-evaluation</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(G,P,\\preccurlyeq_P,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot{\\mathbb Q})=\\mathbb Q\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(H,Q,\\preccurlyeq_Q,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N_2,N,Q,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists K\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\nK=\\{\\langle p,\\dot q\\rangle\\in R:p\\in G\\land\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot q)\\in H\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(K,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{125pt}\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N_2,M,R,K)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(G,P,\\preccurlyeq_P,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot{\\mathbb Q})=\\mathbb Q\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(H,Q,\\preccurlyeq_Q,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N_2,N,Q,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists K\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\nK=\\{\\langle p,\\dot q\\rangle\\in R:p\\in G\\land\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot q)\\in H\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(K,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{125pt}\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N_2,M,R,K)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Iteration is the main tool for complex consistency proofs.</li>\n<li>The intermediate and final extensions, all three orders, the evaluated second forcing, and the combined filter are explicit.</li>\n<li>The theorem identifies a two-step generic extension with a generic extension by the two-step iteration; it does not identify a filter with the formal expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G*\\dot P\">\\(G*\\dot P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>ccc iteration: preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>, builds MA models.</li>\n<li>Proper iteration: preserves more, builds PFA models.</li>\n<li>Finite-support iterations preserve ccc, and proper-support iterations preserve properness in the standard settings.</li>\n<li>Shelah: developed proper forcing theory.</li>\n<li>Applications: Martin's Axiom, PFA, various independence proofs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"054f5df77a4bd18d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"054f5df77a4bd18d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})$ is the exact iteration predicate from [[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Generic}$ and $\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-generic]] and [[58-df-generic-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Generic}$ and $\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-generic]] and [[58-df-generic-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}$ is name evaluation from [[58-df-name-evaluation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"M,N,N_2,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q},\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb R,G,H,K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\preccurlyeq_Q,1_Q\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(G,P,\\preccurlyeq_P,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot{\\mathbb Q})=\\mathbb Q\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(H,Q,\\preccurlyeq_Q,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N_2,N,Q,H)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists K\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\nK=\\{\\langle p,\\dot q\\rangle\\in R:p\\in G\\land\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot q)\\in H\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(K,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,M)\\\\\n&\\hspace{125pt}\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N_2,M,R,K)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"G*\\dot P","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":2524,"backlinks":[{"id":"2b6db6d3eb5ef594","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md|58-thm-iterated-forcing]]（batch19）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection.md]]\n[[58-thm-coanalytic-separation.md]]\n[[58-thm-coding-universe.md]]\n[[58-thm-cofinality-regular.md]]\n[[58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm